sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser as Browser
    participant GW as Gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant KRBP as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Backend as Dashboard Backend<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant K8sAPI as K8s API Server<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant GenAI as gen-ai BFF<br/>8143/TCP HTTPS
    participant LlamaStack as LlamaStack<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant MaaS as maas BFF<br/>8243/TCP HTTPS
    participant ModelReg as model-registry BFF<br/>8043/TCP HTTPS
    participant Thanos as Thanos Querier<br/>9091/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Browser,K8sAPI: Flow 1: User Dashboard Access
    Browser->>GW: HTTPS/443<br/>OAuth Token (OpenShift)
    GW->>KRBP: HTTPS/8443<br/>Bearer Token
    KRBP->>Backend: HTTP/8080<br/>x-forwarded-access-token
    Backend->>K8sAPI: HTTPS/6443<br/>User Bearer Token
    K8sAPI-->>Backend: K8s Resources
    Backend-->>KRBP: Response
    KRBP-->>GW: HTTPS Response
    GW-->>Browser: Dashboard HTML/JS

    Note over Browser,GenAI: Flow 2: Module Federation Remote Loading
    Browser->>KRBP: GET /_mf/{module}/remoteEntry.js<br/>HTTPS/8443 Bearer Token
    KRBP->>Backend: HTTP/8080
    Backend->>GenAI: HTTPS/8143<br/>user_token header
    GenAI-->>Backend: remoteEntry.js (static)
    Backend-->>KRBP: JS Module
    KRBP-->>Browser: Federated Module Chunks

    Note over Browser,LlamaStack: Flow 3: Gen AI Chat (Streaming SSE)
    Browser->>KRBP: POST /_mf/gen-ai/api/v1/responses<br/>HTTPS/8443 Bearer Token
    KRBP->>Backend: HTTP/8080
    Backend->>GenAI: HTTPS/8143<br/>user_token
    GenAI->>LlamaStack: POST /inference<br/>HTTP/HTTPS Bearer Token
    LlamaStack-->>GenAI: Streaming Response
    GenAI-->>Browser: SSE Stream<br/>HTTPS/8143

    Note over Browser,K8sAPI: Flow 4: K8s Watch (WebSocket)
    Browser->>KRBP: WSS /wss/k8s<br/>8443/TCP<br/>base64url.bearer subprotocol
    KRBP->>Backend: WS /wss/k8s
    Backend->>K8sAPI: WSS/6443<br/>Bearer Token
    K8sAPI-->>Backend: Watch Events (streaming)
    Backend-->>Browser: Watch Events (WSS)

    Note over Backend,Thanos: Flow 5: Prometheus Metrics Query
    Browser->>KRBP: POST /api/prometheus/query<br/>HTTPS/8443
    KRBP->>Backend: HTTP/8080
    Backend->>Thanos: HTTPS/9091<br/>Bearer Token
    Thanos-->>Backend: PromQL Results
    Backend-->>Browser: JSON Response

    Note over GenAI,MaaS: Flow 6: Inter-BFF Communication
    GenAI->>MaaS: GET /api/v1/maas/models<br/>HTTPS/8243 inter-BFF
    MaaS-->>GenAI: Model List
    GenAI->>ModelReg: GET /api/v1/registered-models<br/>HTTPS/8043 inter-BFF
    ModelReg-->>GenAI: Registered Models
